{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000165","compactId":"SO_0000165","id":"SO:0000165","label":"enhancer","definition":{"text":"A cis-acting sequence that increases the utilization of (some) eukaryotic promoters, and can function in either orientation and in any location (upstream or downstream) relative to the promoter.","xrefs":["http://www.insdc.org/files/feature_table.html"]},"comments":["An enhancer may participate in an enhanceosome GO:0034206. A protein-DNA complex formed by the association of a distinct set of general and specific transcription factors with a region of enhancer DNA. The cooperative assembly of an enhanceosome confers specificity of transcriptional regulation. This comment is a place holder should we start to make cross products with GO."],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"INSDC_qualifier:enhancer"},{"scope":"broad","value":"INSDC_feature:regulatory"}],"xrefs":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enhancer_(genetics)"],"subsets":["SOFA"],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000165/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"9fa74b87f27dd3f4f1ee360ae1aa45f52d1e7774","shortHash":"9fa74b8","date":"2021-02-08","subject":"Updated name of CRM to cis_regulatory_module to be more specific. See GitHub Issue#526","issueRefs":["#526"]},"entries":[{"hash":"9fa74b87f27dd3f4f1ee360ae1aa45f52d1e7774","shortHash":"9fa74b8","date":"2021-02-08","subject":"Updated name of CRM to cis_regulatory_module to be more specific. See GitHub Issue#526","issueRefs":["#526"]},{"hash":"2e01a41591941793a5d79abbb74bbb25cbd8add5","shortHash":"2e01a41","date":"2020-07-01","subject":"Updated link for INSDC to http://www.insdc.org/files/feature_table.html","issueRefs":[]},{"hash":"5fe48bd4b720f8b140cb0f77461798c55532c097","shortHash":"5fe48bd",